    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295012,295056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シルフと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What to do with Sylph?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>またいらっしゃったのですね。
何の御用ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you've come again.
What is your purpose?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私と再び戦うと
言うのですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You wish to do
battle with me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、私には
あなた方と戦う理由が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, I have no
reason to fight you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうですか、
自らに対する試練と
いうわけですね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, I see. You
wish to challenge
your own limits...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいでしょう、
お相手しましょう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Very well. I will
be your opponent!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の負けです……
またいらしてください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's my loss... Please, do come again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シルフ！
オレらに力を貸してくれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sylph! Lend us
your power!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>契約ですね。
いいでしょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then it's a pact.
Very well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、あなたの持っている
契約の指輪、オパールを
我が前へ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, bring your Pact Ring,
the ring of Opal, before me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我、今、風の精に
ねがいたてまつる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, I offer my request
to the Spirit of Wind.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>指輪の盟約のもと、
我に精霊を従わせたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By covenant of the ring,
may this spirit obey me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が名は&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name is &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたの呼び声があらば、
いつでも参上しましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whenever I should hear your
voice, I will appear without fail.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>契約の指輪を持たない
あなた方とは契約はできません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I cannot form a pact with
you if you lack a Pact Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オパールがあれば、
あなたと契約しましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When you have the Opal Ring,
I will form a pact with you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
